\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs22\lang10 Cadboxx Platform \f1\emdash  Product & Technical Blueprint\par
Vision\par
\par
Cadboxx is a creator economy platform where users:\par
\par
Maintain a platform cash balance/wallet.\par
Earn rewards by completing work and creative tasks inside the ecosystem.\par
Access a suite of integrated creator tools at no cost.\par
Build 3D assemblies using imported models from multiple 3D software packages.\par
Generate renders, simulations, animations, screenshots, and cinematic clips.\par
Mint selected outputs into NFTs.\par
Sell NFTs through an integrated marketplace.\par
Receive revenue shares and royalties into their platform balance.\par
Optionally allocate part of their balance into automated AI-assisted trading strategies with transparent risk controls.\par
